IPlayerContext.allowScanningProcess(name): the processes that choose their targets by scanning every loaded chunk (mine, get-to-block, farm, explore, build) ask the player context before they start and do nothing when refused. A host whose players may only act on what they can observe refuses them; the default allows all, as upstream does.

